{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S09把X中“难受的时候有人陪着”的开放疑问改成“怕孤单到连那些气也肯再受”，对人物动机作了更重的推断，少了一点原版的心理留白。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】突出每段叙事的关键判断，观众即使边听音乐边扫屏幕，也比较容易抓住人物当下的想法和行为动机；感受又随音乐进程出现，不必一开始面对所有信息。更重要的是，Y的感受不只停留在悲伤、焦虑、温暖等情绪标签，还具体写到声响、节奏、动作和身体反应，使人物从怀念、动摇、孤独到重新站稳的过程更细腻，也更容易感受到前后变化的联系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4723af1b-8796-4e14-8953-599cfa13305d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T001158140766Z", "elapsed_seconds": 93.141, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:13:31.300149+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3136247783985f667d1952dfaf95b27f1350cdedba02671b1fec79bf86028aaa", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachm